# Local dev data: SQLite database, downloaded videos, thumbnails, logs, backups. This is 11 GB on a
# working checkout and none of it belongs in a build context — without this line `docker build` copies
# the whole lot to the daemon, which on a nearly-full disk is exactly the condition that has wedged
# SQLite with "Error 10 / disk I/O" here before. See CLAUDE.md.
.dev
